== Trivia ==
*Players can get up to {{Item|Feast Flask|amount=2}}s more from '''Feast Chef Ted'''{{'}}s last milestone, via the {{AN|Leftovers}} perk purchased at {{NPCSprite|Doug}}.
**When factoring in {{AN|Leftovers}}, up to {{Item|Feast Flask|amount=10}}s are available per [[Harvest Feast]]. During the [[Grand Feast]], players can get up to {{Kernels|1,125}} and {{Item|Feast Flask|amount=18}}s from the milestone, on top of any obtained by collecting {{Seasoning}}.<!-- These Feast Flask values already include Doug's perk-->

